~/git-repos/UHDM/build/generated/src/<type>.cpp
        THE AUTHORITY on what uhdm-cmp compares for a node and IN WHAT ORDER,
        and the first thing to read when the bisector says NO CHILD REPRODUCES
        IT.  cont_assign.cpp:107-125 is why § contAssignDriveStrength19 exists:
        VpiNetDeclAssign, VpiStrength0, VpiStrength1 are compared BEFORE Rhs
        and Lhs, and the bisector's r IS the scalar subtraction (r=64 =
        vpiStrongDrive).
pf19.sv       § genForCondQualPkgParamFold19 / § defGenProcWildcardPkgParamNoFold19's
