bisall17.sh   runs 17c over every head and collects the field chains — the way
        the pass-17 ranked residue below was produced.  ~1 min per head.
hdiff17.sh    head diff of two r10earl4h censuses.  METRIC HYGIENE: it compares
        the failLhs/failRhs lines too, because head-line-only comparison HIDES
        AN ADVANCE — § pkgBoundMintTsTopInstance17 moved four heads onto a new
        object with every r still 1 and the head-only diff printed nothing.
gate17.sh <tag>   the whole gate in one command (goldens + u2r testflags +
