  THE PWRMGR/RSTMGR/ALERT/FLASH PACKAGE FAMILY — pass 4's ranked residue (2),
  6 AllPackages + 5 TopPackages heads and 7 parentless ref_typespec module
  heads — IS ONE ROW.  The chain, decoded with r10earl5ts + r10earl5op:
  typespec::Compare recurses Instance(), so comparing ANY of pwrmgr_pkg's 16
  typespecs re-compares the whole package; every one of them, and every
  pattern row 5..12, reported the SAME head; and the head "failLhs
  ref_typespec 0:0 / failRhs <null>" is the pattern operation's own Typespec
