  1. § genScopeEnumTypedef23 + § genScopeEnumVar23 (ModuleEmit ~11334 and
     ~11662).  AN ENUM-TYPED GEN-BLOCK LOCAL IS AN enum_var IN THE ELAB
     gen_scope, and a gen-block-local `typedef enum` LISTS in that gen_scope's
     vpiTypedef.  genLocalVarClass only ever knew the scalar/integer forms and
     the gen-block typedef loop only knew PackedStructType, so BOTH objects
     were dropped: the pass-22 exit frontier's own note was `rel=100 VECTOR
     SIZE 20 vs 18` plus `rel=725 1 vs 0` — CHECK WHETHER THE OBJECT EXISTS
     BEFORE WRITING A BIND LAW, a bind cannot point at an object that was never
     minted.  The new probe r10earl23a (whole-arena census keyed by
     VpiFullName + UhdmName substring) says the family is exactly SEVEN
     enum_vars in the whole design and covers both spellings — a GEN-LOCAL
     typedef enum (ibex_multdiv_fast `mult_fsm_e`, prim_diff_decode `state_e`)
     and a PACKAGE one (ibex_wb_stage `wb_instr_type_e`).  qa23.sv reproduces
     both plus module-level controls and converts to fully CMP_EQUAL.  The DEF
     view keeps dropping them (golden's named_begin stmt-ifies only the plain
     logic locals), so this is elab-only.
  2. § genCaEnumLhsGenLocalBinds23 (UhdmExporter.h genCaLhsGenLocal23,
     ModuleEmit ~12580, ExprEmit ~5033).  THE UNMEASURED QUARTER of pass 22's
     § genCaEnumBindsSelectOnly22: in a gen-scope cont_assign RHS an enum const
     ALSO binds when the CA's LHS is a signal declared in THIS gen scope or in
     an ANCESTOR generate scope.  Every qa22 row assigned a module OUTPUT PORT,
     which is why the quarter was invisible.  qb23.sv puts both LHS shapes in
     ONE gen scope and the LHS is the whole discriminator — `assign l_cmp =
     (s == K_B)` binds while `assign o3 = (l_tern == K_A)` four lines down does
     not — and its gen_outer/gen_inner row says ANCESTOR scopes count.  Corpus:
     ibex_wb_stage.sv:77 `assign wb_done = (wb_instr_type_q == WB_INSTR_OTHER)
     | lsu_resp_valid_i;` and ibex_cs_registers.sv:993/994 `assign
     tmatch_control_we = csr_we_int & debug_mode_i & (csr_addr_i ==
     CSR_TDATA1);`.  Ternary BRANCHES bind here too, so pass 22's no-bind rows
     were all port-LHS rows.
  3. § genCaSelLhsDeepBindGenLocal23 (ModuleEmit ~13110).  THE SELECT-LHS
     QUARTER of § genCaOpDeepBindGenLocal20 — the single largest bind residue
