  4. § dimFoldOverriddenParam23 (TypeEmit ~12356, in buildUnpackedRanges).  An
     OVERRIDDEN module parameter sizing an unpacked dim folds to UINT at
     SIXTY-FOUR bits with NO typespec ref — a third shape next to the law's
     existing "declared width + ts ref" and § dimFoldReducedParam's "INT at
     64, bare".  pt23.sv measures five spellings side by side in one child
     instance (golden's right-bound operand):
       parameter int unsigned, OVERRIDDEN   UINT:16 / 64
       parameter int (signed),  OVERRIDDEN  UINT:16 / 64
       parameter (untyped),     OVERRIDDEN  UINT:16 / 64
       parameter int unsigned, DEFAULT      UINT:8  / 32
       localparam = literal / = a bare ref  UINT:8  / 32
       localparam = ND * 2                  INT:16  / 32
