    written by the ordinary emitExpr path and then again by
    § genCaOpDeepBindGenLocal20's fallback; suppressing either alone measures
    as "no effect" and reads exactly like a refutation.  When a targeted
    suppression measures NO CHANGE, look for a SECOND writer before concluding
    the law is wrong.
