    purpose-built .sv files had not.  On a decoded corpus head, CENSUS THE
    CORPUS SCOPE FIRST, then build the witness to match what the census says.
  * WIDTH IS ALMOST NEVER THE FEATURE.  Both of this pass's ternary laws had a
    width-shaped first hypothesis and both died to a 1-bit row that folds and a
    4-bit row that does not.

