  THE METHOD HEADLINE: **cont_assign::Compare compares vpiStrength0 and
  vpiStrength1, and nothing in the emitter had ever written them.**  Two heads
  that had survived nineteen passes were one *unread field of the comparator*,
  not a model law at all.  When a bisect prints `NO CHILD REPRODUCES IT` on a
  node whose children all compare clean, READ THE GENERATED
  `<type>::Compare` — the failure is in a SCALAR of the node itself, and the
  r value is that scalar's difference (here r=64 = vpiStrongDrive - 0).

  1. § cloneAliasTopTarget19 + § castCloneTopInstance19 (TypeEmit, one new
     design-final pass called from UhdmExporter after importCloneBareTdAlias16;
     round 1).  Pass-18 residue (4), the LAW-S ALIAS TARGET.  A module-scope
     CAST to a package scalar typedef (`w[i] = sha_word_t'(...)`,
