  2. § pkgOwnParamRefActualIsRhs17 (TypeEmit ~9281 + a new def-only map in
     ParamEmit).  pkgParamConst is registered ONLY when a package parameter's
     Rhs came out a CONSTANT, so a localparam with a COMPUTED initializer
     (`AddrW = BankW + PageW + WordW`) or a plain cross-package read
