    chain plus two package views to appear at all.  r10earl15b found the
    owning object in ONE run and r10earl15c named the single differing field
    in the next.  When a head's parent chain ends in `^ design`, the chain is
    telling you the walk arrived by a BACK-EDGE; stop reading the chain and
    drill the listing.
  * A CONTEXT FLAG BEATS A PARENT WALK.  Pass 14's port-connection negative
    was a tree question asked of an emitter that never builds that tree.
    `grep -n 'defRefModConn'` would have answered it in one command: the flag
    was already there, set by the exact loop that emits the actual.
