    immediately; wf.sv, wg.sv and wh.sv did not reproduce theirs at all — and
    wf.sv's failure is what RE-CLASSIFIED the dm_pkg heads out of the fold
    family.  A witness that comes back EQUAL is evidence about the class, not
    a wasted run; all three are committed with their rows intact.

