  wa.sv/wb.sv  § impModFoldSigned (ParamEmit ~236, srlgArithFoldSigned).  `%`
        belongs with `/`, and it was the only arithmetic operator that function
        did not answer: ExprEval's vpiModOp arm is vpiDivOp's twin (both mint a
        signed SValue) and § isIntEncoded — the ELAB-view half of the same
        question — has always paired them.  wa row A (`parameter int A =
        wap::WDW % wap::WBW` wildcard-imported into a module) folds INT:1 ct7 in
