  wc.sv  § impCondFoldKeepsTs (ParamEmit ~7885, the `importedFold` exclusion
        list).  The list named NamedValue / BinaryOp / system Call as the
        import-copy folds that keep their span AND their ts ref; a TERNARY is a
        fourth and nobody had written it down, so `parameter int WordSelW =
        WidthMultiple == 1 ? 1 : LsbAddrBit` went BARE and lost the ts golden
        carries.  Closed the flash_phy_core `ref_typespec '' :0:0` head (it
